Usage:
------

quartus_asm [-h | --help[=<option|topic>] | -v]
quartus_asm <project name> [<options>]
quartus_asm -t <script file> [<script args>]
quartus_asm -s
quartus_asm --tcl_eval <tcl command>

Description:
------------


Options:
--------

	-?
	-f <argument file>
	-h
	-c <revision name> | --rev=<revision name>
	--dni
	--help[=<option|topic>]
	--lower_priority
	--project_hash
	--read_settings_files[=on|off]
	--set=<assignment=value>

Help Topics:
------------

	arguments
	return_codes
	tcl

For more information on specific options, use --help=<option|topic>.

